  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangla Offshore LNG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A project finance loan for the construction of the first off-shore Liquefied Natural Gas (LNG) import terminal in Bangladesh. Bangladesh has been experiencing natural gas shortages due to growing energy demand and depletion of natural gas reserves. The project will provide the crucial infrastructure required for the country to access natural gas from global markets and improve Bangladesh?s ability to reliably use the country?s domestic natural gas reserves. Expanding access to diverse sources of natural gas will promote power reliability, industrial development, and job creation in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
